WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:05.500
Happy Birthday, Ma'am.
Today we celebrate your leadership and your impact.

00:05.500 --> 00:14.000
You guide us with clarity, patience, and consistency.
Your direction helps us make better decisions every day.

00:14.000 --> 00:25.500
Thank you for mentoring with humility,
for setting high standards,
and for trusting us to grow.

00:25.500 --> 00:36.000
Your support has shaped our team culture—
focused, respectful, and resilient.

00:36.000 --> 00:45.000
We wish you a joyful birthday and a year filled with health,
peace, and continued success.
